(360\\) (hundreds place).\n\n9. **Add the numbers together.**.\n   - \\(24 + 210 + 270 = 504\\).\n   - \\(320 + 280 = 600\\).\n   - \\(360 = 360\\).\n\n10. **Combine the sums.**.\n    - \\(504\\) (ones place).\n    - \\(600\\) (tens place).\n    - \\(360\\) (hundreds place).\n\n11. **Write the final product.**. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
