messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 758 and 447? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo find the product of 758 and 447, we can use the standard multiplication algorithm. Here's how we do it step by step:.\n\n1. **Multiply the ones place of the second number (447) by the first number (758):**.\n   - Multiply 758 by 7 (the ones place of 447):.\n     \\[.\n     758 \\times 7 = 5306.\n     \\].\n   - Write down 5306 below the line.\n\n2. **Multiply the tens place of the second number (447) by the first number (758):**.\n   - Multiply 758 by 4 (the tens place of 447):.\n     \\[.\n     758 \\times 4 = 3032.\n     \\].\n   - Since this is in the tens place, we need to shift the result one position to the left:.\n     \\[.\n     3032 \\times 10 = 30320.\n     \\].\n   - Write down 30320 below the previous result, aligning the digits properly.\n\n3. **Multiply the hundreds place of the second number (447) by the first number (758):**.\n   - Multiply 758 by 4 (the hundreds place of 447):.\n     \\[.\n     758 \\times 4 = 3032.\n     \\].\n   - Since this is in the hundreds place, we need to shift the result two positions to the left:.\n     \\[.\n     3032 \\times 100 = 303200.\n     \\].\n   - Write down 303200 below the previous result, aligning the digits properly.\n\n4. **Add all the results together:**.\n   \\[. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
