ow because we are multiplying by the thousands place of the second number:**.\n   - \\(40\\) becomes \\(400\\).\n   - \\(72\\) becomes \\(720\\).\n\n10. **Add all the rows together to get the final product:**.\n    - \\(56 + 400 + 720 = 1176\\).\n    - \\(40 + 400 + 720 = 1160\\).\n    - \\(72 + 720 + 1160 = 2002\\).\n\n11. **Combine the results from each row:**.\n    - \\(2002\\).\n    - \\(1160\\).\n    - \\(1176\\).\n\n12. **Add the results together:**.\n    - \\(2002 + 1160 + 1176 = 4338\\). Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
