messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 361 and 476? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo find the product of 361 and 476, we can use the standard multiplication algorithm. Here's how it works:.\n\n1. Write down the numbers one below the other, aligning them by their place values:.\n   ```.\n     361.\n   x 476.\n   ```.\n\n2. Multiply 361 by the units digit of 476 (which is 6):.\n   ```.\n     361.\n   x   6.\n   ----.\n     2166.\n   ```.\n\n3. Multiply 361 by the tens digit of 476 (which is 7), but remember to shift the result one position to the left because we're dealing with tens:.\n   ```.\n     361.\n   x  70.\n   ----.\n    25270.\n   ```.\n\n4. Multiply 361 by the hundreds digit of 476 (which is 4), and shift the result two positions to the left because we're dealing with hundreds:.\n   ```.\n     361.\n   x 400.\n   ----.\n   144400.\n   ```.\n\n5. Add all the partial products together:.\n   ```.\n     2166.\n   +25270.\n   +144400.\n   ----.\n   171016.\n   ```. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
