n     & 6 & 3 & 6 & 4 \\\\.\n     & 7 & 1 & 5 & 6 \\\\.\n     + & 5 & 6 & 0 & 0 \\\\.\n   \\hline.\n     & 1 & 1 & 1 & 2 & 0 & 8 \\\\.\n   \\end{array}.\n   \\]. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
