: \\(42 + 6 = 48\\). Write down 8 and carry over 4.\n\n   So far, we have:.\n   \\[.\n   \\begin{array}{cccc}.\n     & 9 & 6 & 7 \\\\.\n   \\times & 6 & 9 & 2 \\\\.\n   \\hline.\n     & 8 & 4 & 8 & 4 \\\\.\n     & 6 & 7 & 8 & 4 \\\\.\n     & 4 & 8 & 7 & 4 \\\\.\n   \\end{array}.\n   \\].\n\n4. **Add the results of each step together:**.\n   \\[.\n   \\begin{array}{cccc}.\n     & 8 & 4 & 8 & 4 \\\\.\n     & 6 & 7 & 8 & 4 \\\\.\n     & 4 & 8 & 7 & 4 \\\\.\n   \\hline.\n     & 6 & 3 & 6 & 8 & 8 \\\\.\n   \\end{array}.\n   \\]. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
