messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 445 and 673? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo find the product of 445 and 673, we can use the standard multiplication algorithm. Here's how it works:.\n\n1. Write down the numbers one below the other, aligning them by their place values:.\n   ```.\n     445.\n   x 673.\n   ```.\n\n2. Multiply 445 by the ones digit of 673 (which is 3):.\n   ```.\n     445.\n   x   3.\n   ----.\n     1335.\n   ```.\n\n3. Multiply 445 by the tens digit of 673 (which is 7), but remember to shift the result one position to the left because we're dealing with tens:.\n   ```.\n     445.\n   x  70.\n   ----.\n    31150.\n   ```.\n\n4. Multiply 445 by the hundreds digit of 673 (which is 6), and shift the result two positions to the left because we're dealing with hundreds:.\n   ```.\n     445.\n   x 600.\n   ----.\n   267000.\n   ```.\n\n5. Add all the partial products together:.\n   ```.\n     1335.\n   +31150.\n   +267000.\n   ----.\n   294835.\n   ```. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
