 Write down 3 and carry over 1.\n   - \\(4 + 2 + 2 + 1 = 9\\).\n\n   So, the final product is:.\n   ```.\n   746.\n   ×  6.\n   ----.\n    4476.\n   2238.\n   3730.\n   ----.\n   468960.\n   ```. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
