messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 881 and 623? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo find the product of 881 and 623, we can use the standard multiplication algorithm. Here's how it works:.\n\n1. Write down the numbers one below the other, aligning them by their place values:.\n   ```.\n     881.\n   x 623.\n   ```.\n\n2. Multiply 881 by the ones digit of 623 (which is 3):.\n   ```.\n     881.\n   x   3.\n   ----.\n     2643.\n   ```.\n\n3. Multiply 881 by the tens digit of 623 (which is 2), but remember to shift the result one position to the left because we're dealing with tens:.\n   ```.\n     881.\n   x  20.\n   ----.\n    17620.\n   ```.\n\n4. Multiply 881 by the hundreds digit of 623 (which is 6), and shift the result two positions to the left:.\n   ```.\n     881.\n   x 600.\n   ----.\n   528600.\n   ```.\n\n5. Add all the partial products together:.\n   ```.\n     2643.\n   +17620.\n   +528600.\n   ----.\n   562863.\n   ```. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
