messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 661 and 723? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo find the product of 661 and 723, we can use the standard multiplication algorithm. Here's how it works:.\n\n1. Write down the numbers one below the other, aligning them by their place values:.\n   ```.\n     661.\n   x 723.\n   ```.\n\n2. Multiply 661 by the ones digit of 723 (which is 3):.\n   ```.\n     661.\n   x   3.\n   ----.\n     1983.\n   ```.\n\n3. Multiply 661 by the tens digit of 723 (which is 2), but remember to shift the result one position to the left because we're dealing with tens:.\n   ```.\n     661.\n   x  20.\n   ----.\n    13220.\n   ```.\n\n4. Multiply 661 by the hundreds digit of 723 (which is 7), and shift the result two positions to the left because we're dealing with hundreds:.\n   ```.\n     661.\n   x 700.\n   ----.\n   462700.\n   ```.\n\n5. Add all the partial products together:.\n   ```.\n     1983.\n   +13220.\n   +462700.\n   ----.\n   480063.\n   ```. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
