s result below the previous result, shifted three places to the left:.\n   ```.\n     531.\n   x  265.\n   ------.\n     30.\n   78.\n   10.\n   26.\n   ```.\n\n5. **Add all the results together:**.\n   ```.\n     531.\n   x  265.\n   ------.\n     30.\n   78.\n   10.\n   26.\n   ------.\n   139845.\n   ```. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
