messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 268 and 433? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo find the product of 268 and 433, we can use the standard multiplication algorithm. Here's how it works:.\n\n1. Write down the numbers one below the other, aligning them by their place values:.\n   ```.\n     268.\n   x 433.\n   ```.\n\n2. Multiply 268 by the ones digit of 433 (which is 3):.\n   ```.\n     268.\n   x   3.\n   ----.\n     704.\n   ```.\n\n3. Multiply 268 by the tens digit of 433 (which is 30):.\n   ```.\n     268.\n   x 30.\n   ----.\n    7040.\n   ```.\n\n4. Multiply 268 by the hundreds digit of 433 (which is 400):.\n   ```.\n     268.\n   x 400.\n   ----.\n   107200.\n   ```.\n\n5. Add all the products together:.\n   ```.\n     704.\n   +7040.\n   +107200.\n   ----.\n   117824.\n   ```. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
