messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 372 and 838? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo find the product of 372 and 838, we can use the standard multiplication algorithm. Here's how it works:.\n\n1. Write down the numbers one below the other, aligning them by their place values:.\n   ```.\n     372.\n   x 838.\n   ```.\n\n2. Multiply 372 by the ones digit of 838 (which is 8):.\n   ```.\n     372.\n   x   8.\n   ----.\n     2976.\n   ```.\n\n3. Multiply 372 by the tens digit of 838 (which is 3), but remember to shift the result one position to the left because we're dealing with tens:.\n   ```.\n     372.\n   x  30.\n   ----.\n    11160.\n   ```.\n\n4. Multiply 372 by the hundreds digit of 838 (which is 8), but remember to shift the result two positions to the left because we're dealing with hundreds:.\n   ```.\n     372.\n   x 800.\n   ----.\n   297600.\n   ```.\n\n5. Add all the partial products together:.\n   ```.\n     2976.\n   +11160.\n   +297600.\n   ----.\n   310016.\n   ```. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
