messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 117 and 563? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo find the product of 117 and 563, we can use the standard multiplication algorithm. Here's how it works:.\n\n1. Write down the numbers one below the other, aligning them by their place values:.\n   ```.\n    117.\n   x 563.\n   ```.\n\n2. Multiply 117 by the ones digit of 563 (which is 3):.\n   ```.\n    117.\n   x  3.\n   ----.\n    351.\n   ```.\n\n3. Multiply 117 by the tens digit of 563 (which is 6), but remember to shift the result one position to the left because we're dealing with tens:.\n   ```.\n    117.\n   x  6.\n   ----.\n   702.\n   ```.\n\n4. Multiply 117 by the hundreds digit of 563 (which is 5), and shift the result two positions to the left:.\n   ```.\n    117.\n   x 50.\n   ----.\n  5850.\n   ```.\n\n5. Add all the partial products together:.\n   ```.\n    351.\n   +702.\n  +5850.\n  ----.\n  66511.\n   ```. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
