messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 669 and 757? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo find the product of 669 and 757, we can use the standard multiplication algorithm. Here's how it works:.\n\n1. Write down the numbers one below the other, aligning them by their place values.\n   ```.\n     669.\n   x 757.\n   ```.\n\n2. Multiply each digit of the bottom number (757) by the top number (669), starting from the rightmost digit.\n   - Multiply 7 by 669: \\(7 \\times 669 = 4683\\).\n   - Multiply 5 by 669: \\(5 \\times 669 = 3345\\).\n   - Multiply 7 by 669: \\(7 \\times 669 = 4683\\).\n\n3. Write down the results of these multiplications, aligning them by their place values.\n   ```.\n     669.\n   x 757.\n   ----.\n   4683.\n   3345.\n   4683.\n   ```.\n\n4. Add the results together, starting from the rightmost column.\n   ```.\n     669.\n   x 757.\n   ----.\n   4683.\n   3345.\n   4683.\n   ----.\n   500053.\n   ```. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
